flowchart LR
    subgraph Sources
        Twin[Twin through the Rev B forward model]
        Recording[Recorded bundle]
        Live[Live device link]
        Muse[Muse Gadget SDK: no physiological stream]
    end
    subgraph Loop[CIRCLE boundary and closed loop]
        Ingest[Ingestion boundary: declared losses, link states, host receipt]
        Contract[Input contract: eda, ppg, imu, sync]
        Refused[Refused: recorded as a session]
        Raw[RawSession]
        Pipeline[Pipeline + state estimate]
        Controller[Controller + quality gates]
        Gate[Actuation gate: SIMULATED or NONE]
    end
    subgraph Evidence[Evidence and outside the loop]
        Haptic[Simulated haptic]
        Record[Session record + independent audit]
        Chat[Operator chat, outside the loop]
    end
    Twin -->|device records| Contract
    Recording -->|hash-verified| Contract
    Live -->|deliveries: chunks, events, losses| Ingest
    Ingest -->|GAPs, link states| Contract
    Muse -->|no streams| Refused
    Contract -->|lawful view| Raw
    Raw -->|available at T| Pipeline
    Pipeline -->|arousal index| Controller
    Controller -->|cue| Gate
    Gate -->|SIMULATED only| Haptic
    Haptic -->|execution evidence| Record
    Raw -->|preserve| Record
    Record -->|templated status| Chat
